    "$comment": "Eleven queue families and five fact families share one shape each. Writing the map out sixteen times is sixteen places for one of them to drift, and the drift would be invisible: each copy would still be internally consistent. The shorthand is expanded by the builder and by the guard, from HERE, so there is one definition.",
